WEBVTT

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:06.500
Agari...

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:08.580
Agari.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:10.940
Listen, Agari.

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:16.010
No matter what you do,
always aim for the top.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:21.250
Number one, yeah!

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:23.140
M-Mom?

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:24.600
Now, join me!

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.960
Number one! Number one!

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:29.100
Nu... Nu...

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.760
N-Number one!

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:37.550
<i>My parents named me Agari, for "rise,"
hoping that I'd rise to the top.</i>

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:39.080
<i>I was proud of my name.</i>

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.420
<i>But reality had other ideas.</i>

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:55.740
<i>No matter what I did,</i>

00:00:58.740 --> 00:00:59.450
<i>I was mediocre.</i>

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:02.130
<i>Wherefore am I so?</i>

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:07.040
<i>That's when I finally found it.</i>

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:13.670
You're awesome, Agari-chan!

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:47.160
<b>Scorching</b>

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:47.160
<b>Ping Pong Girls</b>

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:28.300
<i>I'm going to have the crowd
eating out of my hand again.</i>

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:31.880
<i>I'll beat you and feel the
ecstasy of my heart racing!</i>

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:33.160
<i>I won't lose.</i>

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:34.340
I am the ace!

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:03.870
<b>Third Serve</b>

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:03.870
<b>Love It!!</b>

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:10.750
One, two, one, two, and we're here!

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:13.790
Excuse me.

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:19.560
What's going on? Another match?

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:22.080
Exactly!

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:26.220
What's more, today it's Koyori-senpai
and Agari-senpai fighting for the top spot!

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:30.310
An all-out battle with the school's
number one ranking on the line!

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:34.440
It's a top-drawer matchup
between old and new aces!

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.110
Agari-senpai or Koyori-senpai...

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.280
Who is better?

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:41.490
It has to be Koyori-senpai,
the prefectural semifinalist, right?

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:43.450
She has momentum on her side, too.

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:45.370
It's gotta be Koyori-senpai.

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:49.440
<i>My honor as number one is riding on this.</i>

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:50.950
<i>I cannot lose.</i>

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:52.530
<i>I'll crush you like a bug!</i>

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:57.010
Kamiya-san,

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:58.550
l-let's have a good game.

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:09.220
I really wanted to play you again,

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:14.900
so I'm really excited about this match!

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:16.610
My heart's racing!

00:04:21.180 --> 00:04:22.750
<i>Before, matches were like...</i>

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:28.780
Best of luck, Agari-senpai!

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:30.890
I'm rooting for you, Agari-senpai!

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:33.320
School's number one! Team ace!

00:04:33.320 --> 00:04:34.920
Go, Agari-senpai!

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:39.190
<i>Everyone made a fuss over me
and treated me like a superstar.</i>

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:42.880
<i>But now...</i>

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.810
Best of luck, Koyori-senpai!

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:48.970
I'm rooting for you, Koyori-senpai!

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:51.480
Prefectural semifinalist! Team's new ace!

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:53.670
Go, Koyori-senpai!

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:59.440
<i>How is my heart supposed to race
when everyone's rooting against me?!</i>

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:02.200
We will now start the match for
the school's number one ranking.

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:05.630
It will consist of one game,
to eleven points.

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:06.910
Start it up!

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:09.920
Agari to serve.

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:11.370
Love-all.

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:16.330
<i>I'm going to have the crowd
eating out of my hand again.</i>

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:18.540
<i>I'll beat you</i>

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:25.970
<i>and feel the ecstasy of my heart racing!</i>

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:28.220
Here we go, right off the bat!

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:31.480
Agari brought out her trademark loop drive!

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:34.140
Loop drive?

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:43.030
All right!

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:46.600
Agari-senpai struck first!

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:48.280
She scored a backhand winner!

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:49.990
One-love.

00:05:53.180 --> 00:05:55.270
<i>The ball just jumped off my racket.</i>

00:05:56.050 --> 00:05:56.870
<i>Is this...</i>

00:05:58.550 --> 00:06:01.000
Her drives never cease to amaze!

00:06:01.610 --> 00:06:03.940
She's not called one of
the Elite Four Drivers,

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:07.010
the Driver of the North, for nothing!

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:08.860
The Elite Four Drivers?

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:13.700
Oh, it's the moniker given to a group
of players famed for their drives.

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:18.890
And Agari's known to have
the nicest loop drives of them all.

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:23.860
You'd best not underestimate
a city quarterfinalist.

00:06:24.870 --> 00:06:28.110
No one can stop my loop drives!

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:39.760
Hey.

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:40.640
Yes?

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:42.570
What's a loop drive?

00:06:42.570 --> 00:06:43.920
Huh? Er...

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:47.060
Offensive strokes that impart topspin

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:49.850
with varying amounts of speed and spin

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:51.180
are called drives.

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:57.430
Among them, loop drives are the ones
that place the most emphasis on spin.

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:04.160
The stroke, which traces a steep arc
and then stays low after landing,

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:10.400
jumps high off the opponent's racket
due to the heavy spin on the ball.

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:13.000
The slow, floating return
gives the driver a chance.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.330
It sits up perfectly for a smash.

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:20.310
The loop drive itself is not
a particularly rare stroke,

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:23.320
but the amount of spin
on White Panties's loop drives

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:25.250
is head and shoulders above the rest.

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:27.880
You could call it her ultimate move.

00:07:29.890 --> 00:07:31.230
I had no idea.

00:07:31.230 --> 00:07:32.410
Me neither.

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:34.600
White Panties?

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:38.270
<i>I won't lose.</i>

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:40.140
<i>I don't see myself losing!</i>

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:44.690
<i>When I get a chance, I'll use my backhand</i>

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:48.190
<i>and smash, smash, smash!</i>

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:51.240
Hell, yeah!

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:55.180
<i>Loop drives to backhand smashes!</i>

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:57.950
<i>That is my style,
and it guarantees me victory!</i>

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:01.370
W-Wow!

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:03.400
Agari-senpai is dominating!

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:06.000
Koyori-senpai can't do a thing!

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:08.850
That loop drive is way too good.

00:08:08.850 --> 00:08:11.260
Yeah. It's unbeatable.

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:13.600
Could this be over already?

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:15.470
Agari-senpai's gonna win, surely.

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:17.000
Amazing.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.160
Amazing.

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:18.930
Amazing.

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:20.640
<i>Here it comes.</i>

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:21.630
Awesome!

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:23.120
Agari-senpai is awesome!

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.670
You're awesome, Agari-senpai!

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:25.730
Agari-senpai!

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:29.940
<i>It's happening! Here it is,
the greatest feeling!</i>

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:36.600
Awesome! Too awesome!

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:38.870
Too good! Agari-senpai is the best!

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:40.910
<i>My heart's racing!</i>

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:43.580
<i>Go wilder! Praise me more!</i>

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:46.290
Agari-senpai really is our ace, after all.

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.460
She owns that number one ranking.

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:51.180
<i>Yes, yes.</i>

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:52.730
<i>That's exactly it!</i>

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:55.400
<i>I own this spot!</i>

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:56.890
<i>It means everything to me!</i>

00:08:57.400 --> 00:08:58.680
<i>That's why...</i>

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:02.150
I am the ace!

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:18.170
<i>Be it academics or athletics,</i>

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:20.120
<i>I was distinctly mediocre at everything.</i>

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:24.570
<i>But I finally found it.</i>

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:27.470
Agari-chan, you're good!

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:28.700
So cool!

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:30.170
Awesome!

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:31.910
<i>Here, I can win.</i>

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:33.760
<i>I can rise to the top.</i>

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:38.350
<i>A pedestal where others would look
up to me, where I could feel good.</i>

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:41.400
<i>The only place that makes my heart race.</i>

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:43.720
<i>That's what table tennis is to me.</i>

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:53.650
<i>But I wouldn't beat anyone
if I just played around.</i>

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:57.500
<i>In order to win, I had to practice.</i>

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:01.370
<i>And I've done everything I could.</i>

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:06.170
<i>That's why I don't want to lose!</i>

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:09.630
<i>So that Agari stays perched at the top!</i>

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:13.850
The ball jumped up!

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:15.970
And the backhand smash will end it.

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:20.390
<i>This is the end, Tsumujikaze-san.</i>

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:22.850
<i>I am the ace!</i>

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:30.510
<i>It won't stop...</i>

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:38.810
<i>When I see Kamiya-san's
determined expression, my...</i>

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.000
<i>My...</i>

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:54.250
My heart won't stop racing!

00:10:57.830 --> 00:10:59.630
She returned the backhand smash?

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:03.970
Koyori-senpai countered
Agari-senpai's winning style?

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:10.810
Oh, she gave up on the loop drives!

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:12.600
Take a look.

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:14.620
She's countering the backhand smashes

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:16.570
by falling back to put
more distance between them!

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:21.810
Agari-chan's loop drive is only a setup.

00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:24.490
Even if you don't counter it,
you won't lose the point!

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:29.330
So Koyori-chan switched to a defensive
play style that focuses on returns!

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:30.960
Makes sense!

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:35.180
Agari's backhand smashes
aren't exactly lethal.

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:39.460
They're not hard to return once
you get used to them midway through.

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:44.300
<i>You really can't beat players of
Koyori-chan's caliber with your backhand,</i>

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:45.680
<i>Agari-chan!</i>

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:49.340
<i>My backhands aren't working?</i>

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:52.810
<i>That can't be!</i>

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:59.410
She's returning a barrage of smashes!

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:01.570
That aside, this is a crazy rally.

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:04.160
<i>How?</i>

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:06.870
<i>Why?</i>

00:12:08.590 --> 00:12:11.160
<i>Why? Why?</i>

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:13.500
<i>Why?!</i>

00:12:13.860 --> 00:12:14.960
Kamiya-san...

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:21.420
I love table tennis.

00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:30.310
I like how table tennis lets you see your
opponent's face really well up close.

00:12:31.260 --> 00:12:34.180
The first-years were giving it their all,

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:36.710
Hokuto-san wore a calm expression,

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:38.710
Hana-chan had a smile,

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:42.170
and Munemune-senpai had a gentle
expression while playing.

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:49.180
And you're making an incredibly
sharp and determined face.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:53.130
When I'm playing you,
my heart starts racing,

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:55.720
and my body starts scorching more and more!

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:56.750
And I want

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.960
to feel my heart race even more!

00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:08.730
It was the same when I played her.

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:11.600
Koyori-chan's the type who
ups her game in the latter stages.

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:14.610
She brings out the best in her opponents

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:16.560
and still mounts a serious comeback.

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:23.030
The more she uses her smash,
the stronger it gets!

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:28.390
<i>Each time I hear the pleasant
crack of bat on ball,</i>

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:31.980
<i>every time I feel the pleasant
touch of ball on bat,</i>

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:34.290
<i>I feel power surging within me!</i>

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:37.000
Here I come, Kamiya-san.

00:13:40.740 --> 00:13:42.420
Keep your eyes peeled.

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:43.630
This is

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:46.680
who I am!

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:57.980
<i>What was that smash?</i>

00:13:58.780 --> 00:14:00.890
<i>My eyes could barely keep up.</i>

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:08.610
That felt so good!

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.340
<i>Huh? It can't be.</i>

00:14:17.810 --> 00:14:20.690
<i>What the... What the hell is this?</i>

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:23.050
<i>My heart won't stop racing!</i>

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:30.890
<i>It's only supposed to race when I win,</i>

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:33.110
<i>when people treat me like a superstar!</i>

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:39.730
<i>So why is it racing when
I just lost a point to a smash?!</i>

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:53.700
Koyori-senpai with another winner!

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:56.830
She's breaking down Agari-senpai's style!

00:14:58.390 --> 00:14:59.580
Eight-all.

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:02.660
<i>Not only are Agari-chan's
backhand smashes being returned,</i>

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:04.790
<i>Koyori-chan's bringing
out her insane smashes.</i>

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:07.800
<i>There's no way to stop her momentum.</i>

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:10.440
The tables have turned in a flash.

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:13.470
A-Anyway, do your best, both of you!

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:19.610
If she'd just play her natural game.

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:31.390
<i>I'm burning up!</i>

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:36.290
<i>The pleasant sound of a hit,</i>

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.080
<i>and the sensation of impact...</i>

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:45.530
<i>Every time I play table tennis,
my body gets set ablaze.</i>

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:50.010
<i>When did I stop getting this feeling?</i>

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:52.750
<i>When did I...</i>

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:55.180
<i>Just when?!</i>

00:16:19.980 --> 00:16:22.490
<i>Tsumujikaze-san, I...</i>

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:26.700
<i>I do, too.</i>

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:29.750
<i>I also love table tennis.</i>

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:30.760
I love it!

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:33.220
I wubwub love it!

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:39.390
<i>I love it!</i>

00:16:46.550 --> 00:16:47.610
<i>I can't hold it back.</i>

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:54.340
<i>When I'm playing you,</i>

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:57.170
<i>I can't stop my heart from racing!</i>

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:11.100
<i>You see,</i>

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:17.450
<i>after making the ball
jump with my loop drives,</i>

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:19.990
<i>I love smashing it with my forehand.</i>

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:22.950
Wow, what a smash.

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:29.480
<i>Now I've gone and remembered</i>

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:40.370
<i>just how good it feels
to hit the ball with all I've got!</i>

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:50.420
Eleven-nine.

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:52.250
Game to Tsumujikaze.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:54.440
This match is over!

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:57.210
Koyori-chan wins the battle for the top spot.

00:17:57.210 --> 00:17:59.140
From today on, you're our number one.

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:04.200
You were amazing, Koyori-senpai!

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:06.010
Congrats on becoming number one!

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:07.470
Grats!

00:18:07.470 --> 00:18:09.200
Th-Thank you...

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:10.180
I'm so happy for you!

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:11.360
You were incredible!

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:13.780
I want to get better, too!

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:16.190
Okay, I'll take you on, then!

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:18.200
Thank you!

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:21.240
Kamiya-san,

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:25.950
that barrage of forehand smashes
toward the end was amazing.

00:18:26.510 --> 00:18:29.040
My heart wouldn't stop racing!

00:18:31.970 --> 00:18:34.860
But I only scored with that first one.

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:36.340
This match was a disaster.

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:42.770
<i>I prioritized having fun over winning.</i>

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:44.830
<i>Guess I've still got a ways to go.</i>

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:53.870
N-Next time, I'll have fun,
feel my heart race, <i>and</i> win,

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:55.240
so play me again...

00:18:56.540 --> 00:18:59.040
K-K-K—

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:00.700
Koyori!

00:19:02.520 --> 00:19:03.660
Sure!

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:09.330
Thanks for such a fun game, Agari-chan.

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:24.230
Looks like you broke out of your shell
thanks to her, Agari-chan.

00:19:24.230 --> 00:19:26.040
Totally!

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:30.470
You'll make a fine pair,
White Panties and Peach Panties.

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:34.440
Um, Agari-senpai, you were amazing.

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:43.370
We were moved!

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:45.510
You're awesome! Team ace!

00:19:45.510 --> 00:19:46.410
Agari-senpai!

00:19:53.990 --> 00:19:54.740
Thanks.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:20:01.150
<i>I bet those two will get
even better as time goes on.</i>

00:20:01.610 --> 00:20:03.500
I'm so glad I came.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:05.760
I got a great photo.

00:20:06.110 --> 00:20:06.750
Look.

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:12.500
But it looks like Kamiya-san isn't
the only noteworthy one on your team.

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:15.880
Maybe you'll get pretty far in tournaments?

00:20:15.880 --> 00:20:16.810
I sure hope so.

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:18.530
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:20.470
<i>This year, for sure,</i>

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:23.070
<i>I want us to go to Nationals!</i>

00:20:25.900 --> 00:20:29.580
Uh, I hope to have lots more fun
with you, Agari-chan.

00:20:35.800 --> 00:20:37.460
K-Koyori.

00:20:43.190 --> 00:20:46.840
Let's feel our hearts race more and more
while playing table tennis!

00:22:55.850 --> 00:22:58.140
<b>Ushirode</b>

00:22:56.780 --> 00:22:58.140
And, like...

00:22:58.140 --> 00:23:01.150
This Koyori-chan is incredible!

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:03.650
I'm certain she'll be
a valuable asset to our team!

00:23:03.650 --> 00:23:07.780
<b>Breaking!! The Ace's Smile Is Back!</b>

00:23:04.250 --> 00:23:07.780
Oh? That's good to hear.

00:23:08.210 --> 00:23:09.940
I guess it's about time...

00:23:11.670 --> 00:23:14.160
I returned to the team, then.

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:17.020
Is your foot okay now?

00:23:17.020 --> 00:23:19.200
Yeah, completely healed.

00:23:19.200 --> 00:23:20.700
Wanna lick and see?

00:23:20.700 --> 00:23:22.300
I-I don't!

00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:25.540
And licking won't tell me
if it's healed or not!

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:27.760
I'm just kidding.

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:28.920
Sheesh.

00:23:32.260 --> 00:23:36.120
Koyori-chan, huh? I wonder what she's like.

00:23:40.850 --> 00:23:43.860
I can't wait to find meowt!

00:23:43.860 --> 00:24:00.000
Preview

00:23:44.590 --> 00:23:46.810
Agari-senpai pulled her cheeks!

00:23:46.810 --> 00:23:48.990
Koyori-senpai's cheeks are in trouble!

00:23:48.990 --> 00:23:50.070
Beam, beam.

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:51.680
What's the captain like?

00:23:51.680 --> 00:23:53.990
Wanna lick and see?

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:54.710
This is so soothing!

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:54.700
Meow!

00:23:54.710 --> 00:23:58.740
I'm gonna give it my all
in practice again today!
